### DEBE FUNCIONAR - Registro de nuevo usuario
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "testuser",
  "password": "Test123456",
  "email": "testuser@example.com",
  "nombre": "Usuario de Prueba",
  "rol": "USER"
}

### DEBE FUNCIONAR - Activar cuenta
GET http://localhost:8080/api/auth/activar?codigo=CODIGO_DEL_EMAIL


### ========================================
### LOGIN SIN 2FA
### ========================================

### DEBE FUNCIONAR - Login básico (sin 2FA)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "admin123"
}

